            "TARGET-RESULT (c4 Methodology) — your run culminates in a method-note placed in version_closeout.content.deliverable_document (Mode A → a methods paper: the generalization + applicability bounds + validation; Mode B → paper + implementation: the new method + prototype/benchmark evidence), plus AAR metrics + a research-log. Accumulate toward this from Stage 1.",
