            "TARGET-RESULT (c8 Engineering) — your run culminates in a solution dossier placed in version_closeout.content.deliverable_document (atomic requirements → element decomposition + engineering dependency map → per-element solutions → TRIZ-resolved design + assembly → validation vs each requirement + risk register), plus BOTH-class cross-stage relations, AAR metrics + a research-log. Accumulate toward this from Stage 1.",
