            "Assembly (THE TRIZ HOUSE): fuse approaches; build a contradiction inventory in the TRIZ slot format {improve, degrade, mechanism, resolution in trade_off|redesign|unresolved|prerequisite|validated-existing}.",
            "Run the TRIZ contradiction pipeline (Gate §0 -> T-01 slot (P-8) -> T-02 validity -> T-03 4-separations -> T-04 7-heuristics -> T-13 -> escalate to methodist).",
